{"overview":"در جزیره ناهموار برک، جایی که وایکینگ‌ها و اژدها برای نسل‌ها دشمنان سرسخت بوده‌اند، هیکاپ جدا از هم می‌ایستد و قرن‌ها سنت را به چالش می‌کشد، وقتی با بی دندان ، یک اژدهای ترسناک خشم شب، دوست می‌شود. پیوند نامحتمل آنها ماهیت واقعی اژدهاها را آشکار می کند و پایه های جامعه وایکینگ ها را به چالش می کشد.","tagline":"","overview_en":"On the rugged isle of Berk, where Vikings and dragons have been bitter enemies for generations, Hiccup stands apart, defying centuries of tradition when he befriends Toothless, a feared Night Fury dragon. Their unlikely bond reveals the true nature of dragons, challenging the very foundations of Viking society.","tagline_en":"The legend is real.","runtime":125,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["Dean DeBlois"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["US"],"cast":[{"name":"میسون تیمز","role":"Hiccup","photo":"/SfoR8rDtlacuxAHa3mRUfHChEf.jpg","en":"Mason Thames"},{"name":"Nico Parker","role":"Astrid","photo":"/gt0NJClVSCPCEfcPgcLj3f85uLa.jpg"},{"name":"جرارد باتلر","role":"Stoick","photo":"/i54XoxYieuff2w6MwyfwVUBvmR0.jpg","en":"Gerard Butler"},{"name":"نیک فراست","role":"Gobber","photo":"/2CHS4t6miNGLgMQAjhFqb4fFuKS.jpg","en":"Nick Frost"},{"name":"Gabriel Howell","role":"Snotlout","photo":"/u3PTI9FlrpGFZVMoHXZZBiYWMCl.jpg"},{"name":"Julian Dennison","role":"Fishlegs","photo":"/zSFwaT2osi7D2G0vFetub4yCDwi.jpg"},{"name":"برانوین جیمز","role":"Ruffnut","photo":"/mSaZaVNsAVU70VH5go2D2oS8OIL.jpg","en":"Bronwyn James"},{"name":"Harry Trevaldwyn","role":"Tuffnut","photo":"/uYHekOiCHZoob1tW11vTceplA2e.jpg"},{"name":"Murray McArthur","role":"Hoark","photo":"/aW9Ib3PzKuWuSd0YrTIbFLGX877.jpg"},{"name":"پیتر سرافیناویچ","role":"Spitelout","photo":"/atXOX0UQzIZkcnpNj1cluBdHwAE.jpg","en":"Peter Serafinowicz"},{"name":"Naomi Wirthner","role":"Gothi","photo":"/4WqlG6ajdFJUe8vZCKlgWAHUTJ3.jpg"},{"name":"Ruth Codd","role":"Phlegma","photo":"/zNMtd2SJ9WLVqVRMRjlSLGJ6W7e.jpg"}],"trailer":"OWEq2Pf8qpk","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themov